---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { GIVING_URL } from '../lib/site';
---

<Base
  title="Grow Youth Giving"
  description="A simple way for families and communities to help young people learn about giving, with a program and materials you can adapt."
  ogSlug="giving"
>
  <div class="page-head">
    <h1>Grow Youth Giving</h1>
    <p class="lede">A simple way to help young people learn about giving.</p>
    <hr class="page-head__rule" />
  </div>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Learning about money should include how we give it away: what nonprofits
      do, how to decide what to support, and why those choices matter. I built
      Grow Youth Giving because I want more families and communities to feel
      able to make that teaching part of their lives.
    </p>

    <p>
      The idea is simple. Set aside an amount that works for you. Give a young
      person a real choice about which nonprofit it supports. Ask them to learn
      about the organization and explain their choice. The conversation and
      the responsibility are part of the learning.
    </p>

    <p>
      Our family grant-making fund began in 2020. In 2023 I created the site
      to share the approach and materials others could adapt. It is one
      example, with room to change the budget, schedule, and structure to suit
      the people taking part.
    </p>

    <p>
      You can start small. You do not need to reproduce our program or make
      it a large undertaking. The aim is to give young people some resources,
      room to make a decision, and support in thinking it through.
    </p>

    <p>
      The site includes a program outline, sample submissions, and resources
      for families and teachers. If this is something you would like to try,
      those are places to start.
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li><a href={GIVING_URL}>Visit Grow Youth Giving</a></li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.growyouthgiving.org/tools-how">See the family program outline</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.growyouthgiving.org/faq">Read questions about getting started</a>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p>Grow Youth Giving is a resource for sharing an idea. It does not collect donations.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
